{"id":"n61169-1-3","stage":1,"title":"그래서 · 因此","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61169-1-3-1","ko":"일기 예보에서 올여름에 비가 많이 올 거라던데요?","zh":"天气预报说今年夏天会下很多雨，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일기","meaning":"天气","explanation":"일기：天气","readings":[{"term":"일기","audio":"/audio/6786dd1c77aabb011253.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70779","senseId":"1","lemma":"일기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일기","audio":"/audio/6786dd1c77aabb011253.mp3"}},{"text":"예보에서","meaning":"预报","explanation":"예보：预报；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"예보","audio":"/audio/e42802dfc8235a4016cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14141","senseId":"1","lemma":"예보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예보에서","audio":"/audio/a0e638daf373292a7c70.mp3"}},{"text":"올여름에","meaning":"今年；夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"올：今年；여름：夏，夏天，夏季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"},{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22072","senseId":"1","lemma":"올","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올여름에","audio":"/audio/97a13a585243682bf29e.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"올","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}},{"text":"거라던데요?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라던데：回顾听来的内容，作为后文的背景、对照或判断依据。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거라던데요","audio":"/audio/28002b2ca947d0307aed.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6786dd1c77aabb01","term":"일기","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/6786dd1c77aabb011253.mp3","entryId":"70779","definition":"每天的气温、雨、云、风等空气中的状态。","pronunciation":["일기"]},{"id":"e42802dfc8235a40","term":"예보","zh":"预报","audio":"/audio/e42802dfc8235a4016cf.mp3","entryId":"14141","definition":"提前报道以后要发生的事；或指那样的报道。","pronunciation":["예ː보"]},{"id":"d4e5ba0f9d89e827","term":"올","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3","entryId":"22072","definition":"现在正在度过的年。","pronunciation":["올"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f2ec1265ee68bae260d.mp3","spea